# Domain interface rules

- FE `domain/` is **interfaces/DTOs only** — no use-case or repository layer here.
- Prefer `I*` naming aligned with existing files in this folder.
- Mirror backend field names when typing API payloads; do not invent property names.
- If both `Interface` and other suffixes exist for the same concept, ask which to use for **new** types.
- Keep types next to the feature that consumes them when practical; shared types stay under `domain/interfaces/`.
